Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.22,0:00:37.55,Flashback,Young Saki,0,0,0,,No! I don't wanna!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.55,0:00:39.51,Flashback,Young Saki,0,0,0,,Mommy, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.44,0:00:48.11,Flashback,Akiko,0,0,0,,What is it, Saki? If you snack now, \Nyou won't be hungry for dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.11,0:00:50.73,Flashback,Young Saki,0,0,0,,I don't care! I want ice cream right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.73,0:00:53.07,Flashback,Akiko,0,0,0,,You do? Well, that's a shame.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.33,0:00:56.44,Flashback,Akiko,0,0,0,,Dinner tonight's going to be beef stew.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.44,0:00:57.50,Flashback,Young Saki,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.50,0:01:02.31,Flashback,Akiko,0,0,0,,I was planning to make a\N yummy, yummy beef stew.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.16,0:01:06.46,Flashback,Young Saki,0,0,0,,I wanna eat dinner!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.67,0:01:12.21,Flashback,Akiko,0,0,0,,Is that so? Then can we save\Nthe ice cream for another time?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.21,0:01:13.83,Flashback,Young Saki,0,0,0,,Yeah, we can!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.03,0:01:19.66,Flashback,Akiko,0,0,0,,Saki, where should we go next week?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.66,0:01:20.72,Flashback,Young Saki,0,0,0,,The pool!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.15,0:02:58.53,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(730,610)\fnGeorgia\fs10\shad0\an1\bord0\c&HA789E8&\b1\pos(41.714,254.035)}Episode 8 {\fs14}"A Response and Hot M{\c&HCDBD7F&}i{\c&HA789E8&}lk"
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.58,0:02:58.16,Default,Akiko,0,0,0,,Do you have cram school today?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.16,0:02:58.90,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.46,0:03:01.77,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,It looks like the AC's fixed now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.77,0:03:05.28,Default,Akiko,0,0,0,,It sure does. I'm glad \Nwe got it fixed so quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.69,0:03:08.99,Default,Akiko,0,0,0,,Now my girl should be able \Nto study at home again.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.99,0:03:10.29,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Oh...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.89,0:03:12.92,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.99,0:03:17.05,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Say...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.05,0:03:17.80,Default,Akiko,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.21,0:03:25.20,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Does Ayase-san dislike people who divert\Nher from doing what she wants to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.20,0:03:27.17,Default,Akiko,0,0,0,,Um, what do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.17,0:03:32.27,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Well, for example, planning something\Nwithout her input and then asking her to join.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.31,0:03:35.06,Default,Akiko,0,0,0,,Oh, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.60,0:03:40.11,Default,Akiko,0,0,0,,Considering her personality, I don't think \Nshe'd appreciate that very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.57,0:03:43.32,Default,Akiko,0,0,0,,She'd want it all to be \Naboveboard from start to finish.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.41,0:03:47.24,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's what I figured.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.71,0:03:51.46,Default,Akiko,0,0,0,,Oh? Yuta-kun, are you thinking \Nof asking Saki on a date?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.46,0:03:55.58,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,O-Of course not! Ayase-san is my sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.77,0:03:58.22,Default,Akiko,0,0,0,,I'm just kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.68,0:04:02.38,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Ayase-san just seems like the \Ntype to go a little overboard.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.14,0:04:05.29,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,I think you mentioned \Nsomething like that before.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.29,0:04:07.78,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,That she pushes herself too hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.78,0:04:08.76,Default,Akiko,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.29,0:04:12.04,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,She always seems to be on guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.04,0:04:15.34,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,I wonder if she ever actually \Ngives herself a break.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.13,0:04:22.96,Default,Akiko,0,0,0,,And that's why you're thinking about\Ndragging her out to have some fun?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.25,0:04:27.05,Default,Akiko,0,0,0,,I wonder if she's that way \Nbecause I was always so busy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.77,0:04:31.79,Default,Akiko,0,0,0,,It's like she's trying to grow \Nup as fast as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.30,0:04:37.76,Default,Akiko,0,0,0,,I wish I could have given Saki a little \Nmore time to be a carefree child.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.83,0:04:41.05,Default,Akiko,0,0,0,,Yuta-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.42,0:04:47.05,Default,Akiko,0,0,0,,I'd like to ask a favor. \NYou can insist if you have to,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.05,0:04:50.35,Default,Akiko,0,0,0,,but make sure Saki takes a break \Nevery once in a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.01,0:04:55.62,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,All right. Um, but she might hate me for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.06,0:04:57.55,Default,Akiko,0,0,0,,Don't worry!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.55,0:05:01.47,Default,Akiko,0,0,0,,If it comes to that, I'll let you in on \Nwhat Saki's absolute favorite thing is.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.47,0:05:04.48,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,And I can use that to get her to forgive me?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.99,0:05:07.70,Default,Akiko,0,0,0,,Yes, that's for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.63,0:05:23.50,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.50,0:05:27.57,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Listen, about Narasaka-san and the pool—
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.57,0:05:28.52,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,I'm not going.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.78,0:05:31.11,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,I don't have the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.61,0:05:35.71,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,All right. That's that, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.20,0:05:39.73,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,But I changed my mind\Nand am thinking of going.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.47,0:05:45.30,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,So do you think you could give me \NNarasaka-san's contact info?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.25,0:05:47.13,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.58,0:05:48.24,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.39,0:05:50.63,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,U-Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.63,0:05:54.83,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,It's bad manners to give out someone's\Ncontact info without their permission.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.83,0:05:57.53,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Oh... That's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.93,0:06:01.54,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,I'll try asking Maaya. \NI'll let you know when I get an answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.13,0:06:12.44,Default,Kaho,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.44,0:06:13.14,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.47,0:06:17.64,Default,Kaho,0,0,0,,You dropped this.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.98,0:06:20.06,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Oh... When did I...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.71,0:06:22.23,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.80,0:06:30.12,Default,Shiori,0,0,0,,Well, what a coincidence! \NBut is it really a coincidence?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.12,0:06:34.70,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,I just happened to be in the area. \NI go to a cram school nearby.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.70,0:06:36.08,Default,Shiori,0,0,0,,Roger dodger.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.63,0:06:39.16,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Anyway, who were you just talking to?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.47,0:06:41.47,Default,Shiori,0,0,0,,That was a professor from my college.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.47,0:06:45.09,Default,Shiori,0,0,0,,I never expected you to catch me \Ngetting trounced like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.09,0:06:49.72,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Ah... It must be exhausting having \Na serious debate with a professor.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.72,0:06:51.18,Default,Shiori,0,0,0,,That's for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.54,0:06:56.10,Default,Shiori,0,0,0,,But I know how to rejuvenate now and then\N when I'm exhausted, so I'll be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.51,0:06:57.87,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Rejuvenate?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.87,0:07:01.56,Default,Shiori,0,0,0,,Teasing you replenishes \Nthe vigor in my heart, son.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.94,0:07:05.34,Default,Shiori,0,0,0,,Oh, thank you kindly for giving \Nme something to lean on!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.34,0:07:07.10,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Now hold on a second...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.84,0:07:35.87,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,750)\fnArial Black\shad0\fs10\bord1\c&H7E7161&\3c&H633E09&\pos(48.57,284.057)}Stop Shoplifting!
