Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.84,0:07:37.85,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fnArial Black\fs8\shad0\c&H5C564D&\3c&H9BA1A2&\pos(527.467,295.6)}Navigator
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.84,0:07:37.85,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fnArial Black\fs8\shad0\c&H606362&\3c&H9BA1A2&\pos(503.467,323.334)}When You're Searching for a Book
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.95,0:08:04.08,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(650,1)\fnGeorgia\fs13\shad0\bord0\c&H8D8A80&\b1\pos(419.844,266.607)}I'm going shopping, so go on home without me
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.42,0:08:13.09,Flashback - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,I don't expect anything from you,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.85,0:08:16.79,Flashback - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,so I don't want you to expect \Nanything from me either.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.63,0:08:21.10,Flashback - Italics,Yuta,0,0,0,,You mean Narasaka-san, right? \NYou two are friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.82,0:08:26.98,Flashback - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,We are. Although I think Maaya's \Npretty much friends with everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.81,0:08:53.52,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Mixed rice?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.00,0:08:58.67,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Oh, welcome home.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.18,0:09:00.28,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.39,0:09:02.89,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.89,0:09:03.56,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.73,0:09:06.41,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Oh, well...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.41,0:09:11.40,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,You're always doing everything for me. \NIs this okay for dinner?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.81,0:09:15.95,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Sure. You can warm it up in the microwave.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.95,0:09:17.75,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Okay. Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.69,0:09:20.91,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Oh, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.91,0:09:21.94,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.94,0:09:25.18,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,If you leave the lid on, it'll get all sticky.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.33,0:09:28.17,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Oh, no kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.74,0:09:30.51,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Thanks, Ayase-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.32,0:09:42.82,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Want some coffee?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.82,0:09:43.45,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.30,0:09:46.39,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Oh, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.84,0:09:47.91,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Iced okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.57,0:09:49.31,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.67,0:09:55.45,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,So, about the pool thing with Narasaka-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.09,0:09:58.78,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,You're bringing that up again?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.78,0:10:03.83,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Yeah, well, I haven't gotten \Nthe contact info I need yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.31,0:10:07.28,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,She's probably still waiting \Nfor a response from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.97,0:10:10.18,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Fine. I'll give it to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.18,0:10:11.34,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Ah, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.74,0:10:13.90,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,I don't actually care about her contact info.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.89,0:10:17.59,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,I'm not doing this because \NI want to go to the pool.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.67,0:10:21.40,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,I want you to go to and have fun there.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.65,0:10:24.35,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,I don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.81,0:10:30.63,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,I mean, if I said I wanted to go, \NI thought you might get jealous.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.10,0:10:32.11,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.67,0:10:34.49,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Yeah, you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.03,0:10:38.42,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,But why would I get jealous?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.95,0:10:42.62,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Well, don't you actually \Nwant to go to the pool?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.13,0:10:49.83,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Sorry. Akiko-san told me a few things.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.83,0:10:54.57,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,She said that ever since you were little, \Nyou hated the heat and love the pool.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.21,0:10:59.93,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,But that was when I was a kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.21,0:11:04.23,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Ayase-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.47,0:11:13.03,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Ayase-san, you always seem a little different\N when you talk about Narasaka-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.83,0:11:17.45,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Like when we made sweet 'n' sour pork,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.94,0:11:21.83,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,you looked really happy. \NYou had this glowing smile.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.89,0:11:28.73,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,So I figured that if Narasaka-san \Nasked you to go to the pool,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.58,0:11:32.10,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,you'd probably actually want to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.58,0:11:36.99,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,I told you. I don't have the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.99,0:11:38.68,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Yeah, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.10,0:11:41.17,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,I have to study.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.17,0:11:43.14,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Right. I get that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.60,0:11:45.47,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,But you still need to find time to rel—
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.47,0:11:46.51,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,I can't relax!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.39,0:11:53.60,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,This is why I worry about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.53,0:11:59.26,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,If you keep pushing yourself like this, \Nsooner or later, you're gonna crash.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.95,0:12:03.20,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,I know you want to hurry up \Nand become independent,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.97,0:12:06.11,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,but you still have to make time to rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.42,0:12:14.59,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Ayase-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.62,0:12:34.03,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,I'm going to go study.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.11,0:12:41.61,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\fs18\shad0\bord0\blur4\fax.2\c&H464555&\frz18.55\pos(167.428,103.142)}Maaya
Dialogue: 1,0:12:38.11,0:12:41.61,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\fs18\shad0\bord0\blur.5\fax.2\c&H464555&\frz18.55\pos(167.428,103.142)}Maaya
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.07,0:14:08.49,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(640,1)\fnGeorgia\shad0\bord0\fs16\3c&H444242&\c&H000000&\pos(332.259,173.168)}Tuesday, August 25th
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.04,0:14:13.77,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Good morning, Ayase-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.13,0:14:16.39,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.30,0:14:18.50,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Did you not get to sleep?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.08,0:14:20.08,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.84,0:14:22.59,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,At about six o'clock.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.59,0:14:26.54,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Six? You should try to sleep a bit more.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.54,0:14:28.62,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,You don't have work until tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.62,0:14:31.60,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,I'll be fine. What time is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.46,0:14:34.47,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Oh, it's already that late?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.09,0:14:38.59,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,I'm really sorry. There wasn't \Nanything for your dad to eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.04,0:14:42.59,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,It's okay. He had some bread before he left.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.41,0:14:46.48,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,I've never slept in this late before.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.15,0:14:49.08,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Probably the exhaustion catching up with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.64,0:14:51.79,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,It's okay if you want to rest a little longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.20,0:14:53.74,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,I'm really sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.05,0:14:57.16,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,I can make something for you right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.09,0:15:01.00,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Ayase-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.27,0:15:07.18,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.14,0:15:10.74,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,I want you to listen to me and not walk away.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.37,0:15:13.02,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,About what?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.16,0:15:15.10,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,About this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.72,0:15:20.10,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,When you moved in, do you\N remember what you said to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.10,0:15:23.34,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,When we decided to stop \Ntalking formally to each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.35,0:15:31.14,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,"It's a big help if we can \Nsmooth things out this easily."
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.35,0:15:33.06,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.86,0:15:37.72,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,And right now, I can tell \Nhow sleep-deprived you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.18,0:15:41.23,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,I don't want to make you \Ncook for me in this state.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.87,0:15:48.19,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,But it was all my idea to do the cooking.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.19,0:15:51.55,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Rules are one thing. \NBut in reality, things change.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.05,0:15:57.18,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Your mission today, Ayase-san, \Nis not to cook but to sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.18,0:15:58.73,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,B-But...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.35,0:16:02.50,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,I wouldn't be saying this if you \Nwere your normal self today.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.07,0:16:07.80,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,But you know, you've never slept \Nin this late before. Isn't that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.73,0:16:12.57,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,So these are unusual circumstances.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.40,0:16:15.30,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,I'm just a little short on sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.30,0:16:17.30,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,That's reason enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.41,0:16:21.62,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,You have a right to take a seat in this chair.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.66,0:16:23.58,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.55,0:16:30.42,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.56,0:16:38.22,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Think you can eat a piece of toast?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.22,0:16:39.05,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.61,0:16:40.99,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Should I grill the ham?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.99,0:16:42.62,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,I do like it grilled.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.09,0:16:46.11,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,You always brown it a bit, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.15,0:16:49.89,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,That's the way I like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.89,0:16:52.63,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Me, too. It's better a little crispy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.78,0:17:17.35,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Want some hot milk?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.94,0:17:19.76,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.76,0:17:21.61,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,But it's summer.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.61,0:17:23.29,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,The air conditioning is on.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.99,0:17:26.81,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Also, if you're going back to sleep,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.81,0:17:30.10,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,it might help to get a \Nwarm drink inside you first.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.18,0:17:33.13,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,I'll take one.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.06,0:17:34.94,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,You got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.40,0:17:46.65,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Let's eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.20,0:17:49.42,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Let's eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.66,0:18:00.40,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.66,0:18:50.20,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Oh, I forgot. Here's a spoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.82,0:18:51.87,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.22,0:19:37.28,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,We should go to the pool.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.94,0:19:38.66,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.03,0:19:45.44,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Really? That's great.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.61,0:19:48.45,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,But there's one problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.45,0:19:49.18,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.75,0:19:53.12,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,You and I both have work that day.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.12,0:19:54.92,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Huh? What day is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.90,0:19:58.11,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Day after tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.11,0:19:59.71,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.05,0:20:01.86,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Yeah, seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.11,0:20:07.06,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,But since you've decided to go, \Nlet's make it happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.06,0:20:08.92,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Make it happen how?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.92,0:20:11.11,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,We can trade shifts with other people.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.54,0:20:13.56,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Can we really do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.92,0:20:16.15,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Sure, no problem. It'll work out.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.79,0:20:31.74,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Aren't you hot? Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.14,0:20:34.54,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,I'm fine. The breeze helps.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.09,0:20:37.61,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Sorry about yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.04,0:20:38.73,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.22,0:20:44.56,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,After you came to work with Yomiuri-san, \NI was kind of in a bad mood, wasn't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.56,0:20:45.48,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.42,0:20:50.10,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,It's against the rules to hide it \Nwhen we feel uncomfortable, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.68,0:20:53.52,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,It's okay. I'll be totally open with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.98,0:20:58.72,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,If you two are going out, \NI want you to come out and tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.07,0:21:02.88,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,We aren't going out.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.88,0:21:05.08,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Oh, you aren't?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.02,0:21:07.84,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Why did you think we were?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.85,0:21:13.16,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,I don't know... Let's just leave it at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.38,0:21:23.48,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Listen, I think she's a really great person.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.84,0:21:29.45,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,She's kind, considerate, beautiful, \Nand she has a good sense of humor.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.15,0:21:35.23,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Wait, why am I here promoting Yomiuri-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.23,0:21:37.29,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Huh? Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.85,0:21:42.89,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,If I say things like that, \Nit may influence you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.47,0:21:47.31,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,I should keep it to myself. Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.36,0:21:49.32,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,You're forgiven.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.94,0:21:52.59,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,But you really need to stop apologizing.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.59,0:21:53.87,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Okay. Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.47,0:22:04.01,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.24,0:22:08.70,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Why in the world did I bring my bike?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.70,0:22:09.39,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.69,0:22:12.28,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,I don't need it if we're walking together.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.55,0:22:16.42,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,I figured you must've had some reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.26,0:22:20.33,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,No, not at all. It was just out of habit.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.66,0:22:25.31,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Well, that happens sometimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.31,0:22:27.40,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Habits sure are hard to break.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.68,0:22:30.64,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Let's leave it at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.39,0:22:35.80,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,It'll be fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.95,0:23:07.35,Main - Italics,Taichi,0,0,0,,Sunday, August 6th.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.03,0:23:09.45,Main - Italics,Taichi,0,0,0,,We're at the beach today.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.77,0:23:14.80,Main - Italics,Taichi,0,0,0,,It's really sunny. The breeze feels great.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.48,0:23:19.08,Main - Italics,Taichi,0,0,0,,Oh, Yuta! Don't run, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.61,0:23:22.65,Main - Italics,Young Yuta,0,0,0,,Dad, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.24,0:23:26.02,Main - Italics,Taichi,0,0,0,,Hey, you found a bunch!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.02,0:23:28.34,Main - Italics,Young Yuta,0,0,0,,Look at this! I'm gonna give this one to Mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.87,0:23:32.78,Main - Italics,Taichi,0,0,0,,Oh, really? I bet that'll\N make her really happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.78,0:23:33.62,Main - Italics,Young Yuta,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.44,0:23:37.15,Main - Italics,Young Yuta,0,0,0,,I really wanted her to come with us, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.62,0:23:40.16,Main - Italics,Taichi,0,0,0,,We'll come together another time.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.16,0:23:40.85,Main - Italics,Young Yuta,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.64,0:23:44.02,Main - Italics,Young Yuta,0,0,0,,Oh! Next time, let's go to the pool!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.71,0:23:45.82,Main - Italics,Taichi,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.73,0:23:49.99,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fnGeorgia\fs10\shad0\bord0\c&HA789E8&\b1\pos(320,162.606)}Episode 9 {\fs14}"Step{\c&HCDBD7F&}sister {\c&HA789E8&}and Diary"
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.09,0:23:48.46,Main - Italics,Taichi,0,0,0,,That does sound like fun.
